{"ref":"BDB, אָרַח²","hw":"אָרַח²","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אָרַח</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>traveller</em>?<strong>) </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  a man of Asher <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 7:39\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.7.39\">1 Ch 7:39</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  head of a family of returning exiles <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:5\" href=\"/Ezra.2.5\">Ezr 2:5</a> = <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:10\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.10\">Ne 7:10</a>; perhaps = <span dir=\"rtl\">אָרַ֑ח</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 6:18\" href=\"/Nehemiah.6.18\">Ne 6:18</a>.","next":"BDB, אֲרֻחָה","prev":"BDB, אֹ֫רַח"}